@node i2pd服务,  , 服务, 服务
@comment  node-name,  next,  previous,  up
@subsection i2pd服务

@cindex I2pd
模块 (config services i2pd) 提供了 I2pd 服务。以 daemon 形式持续运行 I2pd。

@defvar i2pd-service-type
@url{https://i2pd.website/,I2pd}的守护进程服务类型。此服务类型的值为一个@code{i2pd-configuration}记录。
给出一个简单示例。

@lisp
(i2pd-configuration
              (config-file (plain-file "i2pd.conf" "\
ipv6 = true
"))
              (tunnels-config-file (plain-file "tunnels.conf" "\
[alt-socks]
type = socks
address = 127.0.0.1
port = 14447
keys = socks-keys.dat

[IRC2]
type = client
address = 127.0.0.1
port = 6669
destination = irc.ilita.i2p
destinationport = 6667
#keys = irc-client-key.dat")))
@end lisp

示例配置 I2pd 允许 IPv6 连接，创建了两个 tunnel ，分别为 socks 代理 和 IRC 聊天。

@end defvar


